/-!
# Cumulative Pi/Sigma/identity calculus instances

Concrete cumulative universe profiles, declared inductive families, checked
computation, contextual models and HOL interpretations. These are mathematical
calculus instances, not a selected programming language. The parameterized
syntax and general laws live in `ParameterizedPiSigmaId`.
-/
